{%- if use_databricks %}
Deploy the project to Databricks using Asset Bundles.

Ask the user which target environment: dev (default) or prod.

Steps:
1. Run `databricks bundle validate -t <target>` to check the bundle is valid
2. If validation passes, run `databricks bundle deploy -t <target>`
3. Report the deployment result
4. If deploying to prod, remind the user to verify in the Databricks workspace
{%- else %}
Databricks deployment is not configured for this project.
To enable it, re-run `copier update` and set `use_databricks=true`.
{%- endif %}
